{
  "title": "Tewiz — santé de la marketplace",
  "description": "Import: Dashboards > New > Import > coller ce JSON > choisir la source Prometheus. Panneaux ordonnés du plus décisionnel au plus technique.",
  "tags": [
    "tewiz"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Source",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "La marketplace",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Courses servies (1 h)",
      "description": "Part des courses de la dernière heure qui ont trouvé un captain. Vaut 1 quand aucune course n'a été demandée — c'est la convention 'pas de trafic', pas un 100 % de réussite : lire avec le panneau 'Courses demandées'.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "tewiz_fill_rate_1h",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "servies"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.7
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.9
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Courses demandées / heure",
      "description": "Le volume. Sans lui, aucun taux n'est interprétable.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 9,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(tewiz_rides_requested_total[1h])) * 3600",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "toutes"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum by (ride_type) (rate(tewiz_rides_requested_total[1h])) * 3600",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "{{ride_type}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Temps de matching (p50 / p95)",
      "description": "Secondes entre la demande et l'acceptation par un captain, calculées en SQL sur la dernière heure (survivent aux redémarrages). Au-delà de 120 s en p95, un client a déjà abandonné.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 9,
        "x": 15,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "tewiz_time_to_match_seconds_1h",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "p{{quantile}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 60
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 120
              }
            ]
          },
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 5,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "dashed"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "L'offre",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Captains : annoncés vs utilisables",
      "description": "L'écart entre 'en ligne' et 'position périmée' est la réponse à « il y avait des captains mais personne n'a été servi ». À lire avec tewiz_dispatch_location_freshness_enforced : si la garde est désactivée, une position périmée ne coûte rien.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "tewiz_captains_online_now",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{presence}}"
        },
        {
          "expr": "tewiz_captains_online_stale_location",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "position périmée"
        },
        {
          "expr": "tewiz_captains_blocked_low_balance",
          "refId": "C",
          "legendFormat": "solde insuffisant"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Où l'on échoue (zones H3, 1 h)",
      "description": "Courses restées sans captain, par cellule de ~5 km². C'est la carte de recrutement : les zones du haut sont celles où il manque des captains, pas celles où il y a le plus de demande.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(5, tewiz_zone_rides_unfilled_1h)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{h3}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "continuous-YlRd"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "orientation": "horizontal"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Dispatch",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Captains qui perdent la course",
      "description": "Le chiffre qui décide du chantier 'une course, un captain à la fois'. 'not_searching' = un autre captain a été plus rapide : ils se disputent les mêmes courses. Proche de 0 → pas de problème de concurrence, le chantier ne vaut pas son risque.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (rate(tewiz_ride_accept_rejected_total[1h])) * 3600",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{reason}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Migration Redis — écarts et replis",
      "description": "En mode ombre. ATTENTION : un repli ne produit AUCUN écart, ce qui se lit exactement comme un accord parfait. Toujours lire les deux courbes ensemble. 'missing' doit rester à zéro plusieurs jours avant de passer DISPATCH_GEO_SOURCE=redis.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (direction) (increase(tewiz_dispatch_geo_mismatch_total[1h]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "écart {{direction}}"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (increase(tewiz_dispatch_geo_fallback_total[1h]))",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "repli {{reason}}"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum by (source) (increase(tewiz_dispatch_eligible_duration_seconds_count[1h]))",
          "refId": "C",
          "legendFormat": "sélections ({{source}})"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Argent, sauvegardes, machine",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Portefeuilles incohérents",
      "description": "Doit valoir 0 en permanence. Un seul échantillon non nul = les soldes et le grand livre divergent, donc l'argent dû aux captains est faux. C'est l'alerte de priorité 1.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "tewiz_wallet_ledger_drift_rows",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Âge de la dernière sauvegarde",
      "description": "-1 signifie qu'aucun dump n'a été trouvé, pas qu'il vient d'être pris. Rouge au-delà de 26 h.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 24
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "tewiz_db_backup_age_seconds",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 86400
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 93600
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Expédition des WAL",
      "description": "Age de la derniere expedition reussie. C'est le signal de sante : le NOMBRE de segments locaux ne dit rien, ship-wal.sh en conserve WAL_KEEP_DAYS deja expedies, donc il monte a plusieurs milliers normalement.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 24
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "tewiz_wal_last_ship_age_seconds",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "depuis la derniere expedition"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 900
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requête d'inbox — p95",
      "description": "La requête la plus chaude : chaque captain en ligne la lance en boucle. Quand sa p95 monte, le dispatch se dégrade pour tout le monde en même temps. NB : elle scanne `rides` et n'est pas affectée par la migration Redis.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 29
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(tewiz_dispatch_inbox_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "inbox p95"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, source) (rate(tewiz_dispatch_eligible_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "sélection p95 ({{source}})"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 5
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "La machine est-elle saturée ?",
      "description": "Tewiz partage ce serveur avec studara-api (6 processus), ai-whisper, tewiz-voice-api et PostgreSQL. Le retard de boucle d'événements est le premier signe que l'API se fait étouffer par ses voisins — l'argument chiffré pour sortir la base sur sa propre machine.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 29
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "tewiz_nodejs_eventloop_lag_p99_seconds",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "boucle d'événements p99"
        },
        {
          "expr": "1 - avg(rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=\"idle\"}[5m]))",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "CPU machine"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 5
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "CPU machine"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percentunit"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}